{"title":"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For how many positive integers <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/d/9cdac1708f3cf392d8366e72868c44c7c84d0448.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+\\dotsb+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"119\" height=\"15\" /> evenly divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/2/d621409978709c8c25a6a8e42a7d4fd78bb57ac1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" />? \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/c/a0ccb28d806fe623e65240034448da9fe739ae5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) } 3\\qquad \\textbf{(B) } 5\\qquad \\textbf{(C) } 7\\qquad \\textbf{(D) } 9\\qquad \\textbf{(E) } 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"364\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>By a standard result, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/7/a57d83706f4e60ff4beb9b7cafd49e02aef8a3f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1+2+\\dotsb+n = \\frac{n(n+1)}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"214\" height=\"40\" />, so this will evenly divide <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/2/d621409978709c8c25a6a8e42a7d4fd78bb57ac1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> precisely if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/6365d63c11e5d1a3bfac1669a6329806595f4523.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{6n}{\\left(\\frac{n(n+1)}{2}\\right)} = \\frac{12}{n+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -31px\" width=\"145\" height=\"56\" /> is an integer, or equivalently, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/c/99cb3f3a8b3bbfc702c5863d16602a06cded535d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(n+1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"54\" height=\"18\" /> is a factor of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />. \n</p><p>The positive factors of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/d/f/edf074831eb5bc9e61d6d6e09f525a86e3068f6a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> (i.e. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> factors in total), but as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> must be a positive integer, we must have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/a/5caa9f53ba3e45fe6ecce652d8099baa8bcdf2b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n+1 \\geq 1+1 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"142\" height=\"16\" />. Therefore, the factor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> cannot be used, but all the others can, giving <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/e/59e33c3dc5e17362dc1f56d7df93c5d814471930.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6-1 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B) } 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"122\" height=\"30\" /> possible values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> (namely, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> can be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/a/4/5a47fb988162ee537bf90d7d4721bef5cc57f264.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2-1 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/b/8fb5f6c3427b92ece10803431a3234552ebf8e5b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3-1 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/c/39caa5b184df22e89aa69e8be623ab73805a46f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4-1 = 3$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"73\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/3/b/23bc444dbcd248cd858f65a1d22c119b3a602cb2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6-1 = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" />, or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/7/747a1f33bb781caa89751ddd4dd1a980e54ff602.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$12-1 = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" />).\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/WRv86DHa3zY\">https://youtu.be/WRv86DHa3zY</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A\">2005 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2005 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <